On the topic of ideas:
  Dune readers know that a crysknife shouldn't be put back without
drawing blood.  What is a crysknife would be cursed, until you hit
a creature?  Simple, and in the spirit of dune.

  Your god should get angry at you for using a weapon of the wrong
alignment.  It's easy enough to find out you're god is miffed at you,
and it makes sense.  Anyone should be able to use any weapon in my
opinion.  If you care about gods and want to pray a lot, you should 
watch what you wield.  If you'd rather ignore gods, then you can do what
you like.  (the Lazia-fare brand of religion)
(sorry about the spelling of that )
I like stormbringer turning off the safepet and comfirm-shopkeeper-
hits options.  I think you should be able to swing over pits when using
the bullwhip-of-indianna.  I think there should be alters on the first
level, and you should be able to choose alignment by praying at them.

